          "python",
          "Data Engineer: \"I've built a pipeline that ingests sales data daily\"\n               \u2192 Feature Store (features refreshed at 2 AM)\n\nML Engineer:   \"I trained 10 models, best achieves 87% accuracy\"\n               \u2192 Logs experiments in MLflow\n               \u2192 Registers best model\n\nMLOps Engineer: \"I've set up monitoring. Model will retrain if accuracy\n                drops below 85% or data drift detected\"\n                \u2192 Deploys to shadow environment\n                \u2192 Canary to 5% of traffic\n                \u2192 Monitors for 1 week\n                \u2192 Full rollout\n\nAll roles:     Monitor performance in production\n               \u2192 Alert if issues\n               \u2192 Collaborate on root cause\n               \u2192 Plan next iteration"
