        [
          "python",
          "Level 0 (Manual):\n- Data scientist trains model monthly on laptop\n- Manually tests on recent data\n- Emails model to backend team\n- Deployed manually; no alerts\n\nLevel 2 (Basic MLOps):\n- Daily data pipeline (DVC tracks data versions)\n- Feature store with transaction features\n- Weekly scheduled retraining (Airflow)\n- Experiment tracking (MLflow)\n- Model monitoring (fraud caught vs false positives)\n- Alert if fraud detection rate drops below 92%\n- Automatic rollback if performance degrades\n\nLevel 3 (Advanced):\n- Real-time feature computation\n- AutoML explores 100s of models\n- Multi-armed bandit testing (tries different thresholds)\n- Drift detection triggers emergency retraining\n- Self-healing: automatically adjusts to seasonal patterns\n- Cost optimization: stops unnecessary models"
        ]
      ]
    }
